Purpose: Delete every remaining utility command, the uninstall command with the installation service, and the run command's --attach option (Plan 0005). The providers, account and console, models, agent, mcp, session, export, import, stats, plugin, db, debug, generate, and pr commands and the yargs completion command are removed; the CLI surface is now exactly the TUI and run. With uninstall gone, Installation.method() has no caller left, so the installation service module and its two layer registrations are deleted as well. The run --attach option and its remote-server code path (instance and directory resolution, file content inlining for remote servers, the agent fallback, and the boot branch) are deleted; run is local only, and its password and username options go with the attach path they served. Upstream tests and help snapshots that covered only the deleted surface are removed or updated inside this patch.
